<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="holy-paladin-pre-raid">Holy Paladin - Pre-Raid</h4>This is the best possible setup you could have before stepping into a single raid in Phase 4. With the addition of both Protocol Twilight and three new dungeons this phase, it is possible to collect raid level gear form the Tier 12 instances without ever stepping foot in them. Some of this available gear from dungeons even replaces Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> gear!<br/>
<br/>The set below should be considered aspirational, as the average player will be able to start collecting Normal and/<wbr/>or Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> raid gear long before they would have enough <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a> or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> to purchase everything included.<br/>
<br/>
