<div id="tab-pre-raid-firelands-raider" style="display: none;">
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="holy-paladin-firelands-raider">Holy Paladin - Firelands Raider</h4>The following represents the week 1 Pre-Raid BiS set for those who have been raiding Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a> up to this point. This set is not relevant for newer characters after the week of February 18th, 2025 who will have more <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> available. There is no need to raid previous tiers for catch-up gear in Cataclysm Classic if you do not already have these items.<br/>
<br/>
