<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Holy Paladin Healer</h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-holy-paladin-healer">Head for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>While <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77153/glowing-wings-of-hope">
