<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-holy-paladin-healer">Wrist for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>The <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=164/blacksmithing">
<img alt="Blacksmithing" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_blacksmithing.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blacksmithing</span></a> is an amazing, if likely expensive, option this tier. At the same time, there is not much to spend <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> on in Phase 4, so deciding if the small upgrade is worth the gold will depend on your budget. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85010/draconic-embossment-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Intellect</span></a> (<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/professions/leatherworking/overview">Leatherworking</a>) &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96262/enchant-bracer-mighty-intellect">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mighty Intellect</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74237/enchant-bracer-exceptional-spirit">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Exceptional Spirit</span></a> (budget) <b>+</b> <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55628/socket-bracer">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_socketedbracer.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Socket Bracer</span></a> (<a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/guide/professions/blacksmithing/overview">Blacksmithing</a>)<div class="pad"></div>
