<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-holy-paladin-healer">Legs for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Similar to the waist slot, there is an unlisted BoE option in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71982/pyrium-legplates-of-purified-evil">
<img alt="Pyrium Legplates of Purified Evil" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_raidpaladin_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pyrium Legplates of Purified Evil</span></a>. As this item requires raid materials it may be prohibitively expensive, but it is worth considering for those looking to gear up as quickly as possible. Otherwise, options for the legs slot are pretty lackluster at the pre-raid level; while the items below are ranked in terms of standalone power, the best choice will remain whatever gives you access to as many tier-set bonuses as possible. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Leg Armor:</b> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=54450/powerful-ghostly-spellthread">
<img alt="Powerful Ghostly Spellthread" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_astralrecalgroup.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Powerful Ghostly Spellthread</span></a>
