<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-holy-paladin-healer">Feet for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Great <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> option for feet that is also BoE. There is very little reason to consider any other item, as this choice will last you into Heroic raiding, (though it is worth noting that its replacement is easily accessible as it drops from the first Heroic boss in <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a>).<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Feet Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74199/enchant-boots-haste">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Haste</span></a>. Some builds that do not take <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=26023/pursuit-of-justice">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_persuitofjustice.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pursuit of Justice</span></a> use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=47901/enchant-boots-tuskarrs-vitality">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Tuskarr's Vitality</span></a> (budget)<div class="pad"></div>
