<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-holy-paladin-healer">Trinkets for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>Unlike previous tiers, at first glance there are many great trinkets in Phase 4 to chose from. The truth is a bit more complicated; the table below lists available trinkets in our of raw output, but only in a simulated setting. Despite being favored by some players, it is likely that in actual PvE content <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77969/seal-of-the-seven-signs">
<img alt="Seal of the Seven Signs" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_runestone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Seal of the Seven Signs</span></a> will under perform, and that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65124/fall-of-mortality">
<img alt="Fall of Mortality" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cat_trinket12.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fall of Mortality</span></a> will continue to vastly outperform what its ilvl and ranking below suggests. Savvy players will collect as many trinkets as possible and swap between them depending on the demands of each encounter.<div class="pad"></div>
