<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-holy-paladin-healer">Relics for Holy Paladin Healer</h4>While there is technically a new pre-bis option in Phase 4, it is an incredibly weak option and should be among your last priorities when looking to spend <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. Additionally, the second best option, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71149/singed-plume-of-aviana">
<img alt="Singed Plume of Aviana" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_feather_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Singed Plume of Aviana</span></a>, upgrades to the expansion BiS item if you get a chance to run Heroic <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5723/firelands">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Firelands</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
